WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.502
Cannabis is being built as money for useful computing. Requesters buy

00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:09.003
services. Providers earn for accepted delivery. Clear commitments connect the currency

00:00:09.003 --> 00:00:10.640
to work people need.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:16.425
A provider offer specifies the computing service, price, availability, and delivery

00:00:16.425 --> 00:00:21.911
terms. The reservation system must prevent overbooking. Protected workers return encrypted

00:00:21.911 --> 00:00:25.900
results for your client to verify and assemble.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:31.142
The founder receives one percent of accepted payments. Service backing requires

00:00:31.142 --> 00:00:36.083
real available capacity and fulfilled commitments. Those provider integrations are being

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:41.025
prepared. Explore the economic design and help build a network that

00:00:41.025 --> 00:00:43.720
earns its place through useful work.
